-    """
-    Exponential moving average: smoothing to give progressively lower
-    weights to older values.
-
-    Parameters
-    ----------
-    smoothing  : float, optional
-        Smoothing factor in range [0, 1], [default: 0.3].
-        Increase to give more weight to recent values.
